    "sentence_translations": [
      "My Girlfriend Fell in Love with a Fox",
      "",
      "Today, my girlfriend took me to see the Chinese dubbed version of “Zootopia”.",
      "I think I understood more than half and I was very happy.",
      "Especially the scenes with the sloth, which made fun of the efficiency of government officials, to great comic effect.",
      "I couldn't stop laughing!",
      "After the movie, my girlfriend looked sad, so I asked her: “What happened?”",
      "She stared at me with pitiful eyes, and said: “I’m done; I fell in love with the fox.”"
